---
title: "oauth_authorize (stem-system: Clubhouse Manager)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse_params: extract client_id, redirect_uri, state, response_type, code_challenge, code_challenge_method
    q_parse_params --> q_validate_required: params parsed
    q_validate_required --> q_error_params: missing required params (client_id, redirect_uri, state, code_challenge)
    q_validate_required --> q_check_response_type: all required present
    q_error_params --> [*]: return 400 invalid_request
    q_check_response_type --> q_error_response_type: response_type != code
    q_check_response_type --> q_check_method: response_type == code
    q_error_response_type --> [*]: return 400 unsupported_response_type
    q_check_method --> q_error_method: code_challenge_method != S256
    q_check_method --> q_check_auth: code_challenge_method == S256
    q_error_method --> [*]: return 400 invalid_request (only S256 supported)
    q_check_auth --> q_store_redirect: user not authenticated
    q_check_auth --> q_verify_client: user authenticated via Supabase session
    q_store_redirect --> q_redirect_login: set oauth_redirect httpOnly cookie with full OAuth params
    q_redirect_login --> [*]: redirect to /login
    q_verify_client --> q_rpc_get_app: call get_application_by_client_id(client_id)
    q_rpc_get_app --> q_error_client: client not found
    q_rpc_get_app --> q_validate_redirect: client found
    q_error_client --> [*]: return 400 invalid_client
    q_validate_redirect --> q_error_redirect: redirect_uri not in registered URIs
    q_validate_redirect --> q_check_consent: redirect_uri valid
    q_error_redirect --> [*]: return 400 invalid_redirect_uri
    q_check_consent --> q_redirect_consent: call check_user_consent RPC
    q_redirect_consent --> [*]: redirect to /oauth/authorize/consent with params + app_name + has_consent

    note right of q_check_method
        INV-001: only PKCE S256 code challenge method is accepted
        INV-002: response_type must be "code" (authorization code flow only)
    end note

    note right of q_check_auth
        INV-003: unauthenticated users are redirected to login before any client validation
        INV-004: OAuth params are preserved in httpOnly cookie across login redirect
    end note

    note right of q_validate_redirect
        INV-005: redirect_uri must exactly match a registered URI for the client
        INV-006: client_id must correspond to an active registered application
    end note
